    M -->|KYC, dashboard, / handoff| VP
    J -->|Validation dossiers| VP
    T -->|AML, conflits NIU, / agences| VP
    S -->|Centre de commande, / analytics| VP
    AIT -->|Agents, ATM, audit| VP
    MAINT -->|Déploiement, / backups, ops| VP

    VP -->|OTP sortants, / emails| SMS
    VP -->|Sync hebdomadaire| OS
    VP -.->|Si OCR_ONLINE=true / payload chiffré| OCR_CLOUD

    VP -->|Après APPROVED : / app-link + store fallback| BIPAY
    VP -->|Après APPROVED : / app-link + store fallback| WALLET

    classDef ext fill:#FFF3E0,stroke:#E65100,color:#000
